# User unit for big and nano (~/.config/systemd/user/mmo-backup.timer): mmo-backup.service every hour (docs/betrieb.en.md "Backups").
[Unit]
Description=Hourly online backup of the spaces-mmo world Spaces

[Timer]
OnCalendar=hourly
RandomizedDelaySec=120
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
